{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-ceiling-light-cct-6000-6500k-2601-0181","content_id":"6597ac83-526e-408d-8eda-cb2bfa3dda13","description":"Product Safety Report for Ceiling Light CCT:6000-6500K sold via Amazon presenting a serious risk of electric shock.\r\n","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"d08e33e0-38f1-44a5-a122-ff2de7c68f9a","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-01-21T13:50:15+00:00","id":"d08e33e0-38f1-44a5-a122-ff2de7c68f9a","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-01-21T13:50:15+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6970d9977e827090d02d42cd/2601-0181-product-safety-report-ceiling-light.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Ceiling Light, CCT:6000-6500K</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of electric shock as it is inadequately earthed.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Lighting equipment - Mounted Lighting</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>CCT:6000-6500K (white)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon product identifiers</td>\n      <td>X001X10KG7, FBA15KYPJS7DU000001</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>SKU</td>\n      <td>CL-YZ4FBK-C-FBA1</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A black and white ceiling light with attached wiring for installation.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_d08e33e0-38f1-44a5-a122-ff2de7c68f9a\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6970d9977e827090d02d42cd/2601-0181-product-safety-report-ceiling-light.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of electric shock as it is inadequately earthed. Under fault conditions, accessible metal parts may become live, causing the user to receive an electric shock. Improvements are also required to marking, labelling and documentation.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2601-0181</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-23T15:42:54Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"lighting-products","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-01-21","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-01-23T15:42:54+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-ceiling-light-cct-6000-6500k-2601-0181","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-ceiling-light-cct-6000-6500k-2601-0181","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-ceiling-light-cct-6000-6500k-26